# Routine "Weekly proof roundup": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Monday morning, what new proof came in, which customers are ready for a case study, which approvals are still sitting, and which claims have nothing behind them.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/customer-stories && pi -p "/weekly-proof-roundup"
